 "editorNote": "Welcome to the first edition. Thirty-six papers across four desks, most from the past two weeks. Every citation has been checked against PubMed, but the summaries are written from abstracts, so read the paper before you quote a number. Three Technology items are bioRxiv preprints and are flagged as such.",
